    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Rank firms by their annual revenue growth each year over the past 5 years. MeanRankRevGrowth is the weighted average of ranks over the past 5 years, that is, MeanRankRevGrowth = (5*Rank$_{t-1}$ + 4*Rank$_{t-2}$ + 3*Rank$_{t-3}$ + 2*Rank$_{t-4}$ + 1*Rank$_{t-5}$)/15. Exclude NASDAQ stocks. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.2；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=LS port。股票池/过滤：exchcd%in%c(1,2)。 Notes：Lots of supporting results, but not exactly what we do. Tab 6 panel 2 finds t=4.5 using 3x3 sort with CF and LS corners.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
